WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.901
SIEM should be viewed as one layer within a broader security program.

2
00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:15.974
It works alongside endpoint protection, EDR, vulnerability management, identity security, firewalls, cloud monitoring, incident response processes, and security awareness efforts.

3
00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:24.695
SIEM provides visibility and analysis, helping organizations detect suspicious activity and investigate incidents more efficiently.

4
00:00:24.695 --> 00:00:29.913
It does not stop every incident by itself, and it does not make other controls unnecessary.

5
00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:36.109
Its value is strongest when it complements prevention, monitoring, response, and continuous improvement.

6
00:00:36.109 --> 00:00:43.543
When combined with skilled analysts and effective processes, SIEM becomes a valuable force multiplier for defenders.

7
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:52.832
It helps teams turn raw logs into operational awareness, connect events across systems, and make better decisions during investigation and response.
